WEBVTT

01:36.289 --> 01:41.130
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.390 --> 01:43.930
[Episode 36]

01:53.000 --> 01:53.920
This cloak...

01:59.680 --> 02:01.810
This cloak belonged to my sister Yuan.

02:02.480 --> 02:03.040
Senior.

02:04.310 --> 02:06.710
There were too many people around earlier,

02:06.840 --> 02:09.240
so I didn't have a chance
to return it to you.

02:14.150 --> 02:15.150
Old Madam Wu

02:16.070 --> 02:17.400
and Sect Leader Zhichen

02:18.000 --> 02:19.660
entrusted me to give it to you.

02:28.560 --> 02:30.750
Sect Leader Zhichen once mentioned

02:32.110 --> 02:33.640
that back then, your sister

02:33.710 --> 02:35.770
was kidnapped by the Jiang brothers.

02:36.150 --> 02:37.680
During her escape,

02:38.000 --> 02:40.680
she unfortunately contracted
a serious illness.

02:40.680 --> 02:42.310
Fortunately, Sect Leader Zhichen

02:42.310 --> 02:44.520
happened to pass by
and was able to save her.

02:44.520 --> 02:45.380
But after that,

02:48.240 --> 02:49.840
there was no more news of her.

03:10.680 --> 03:11.750
It was all my fault.

03:15.470 --> 03:17.000
This is the greatest regret

03:18.800 --> 03:20.000
of my entire life.

03:40.390 --> 03:43.380
[Tang Yaoshun]

03:43.430 --> 03:45.760
The Tang Sect is already under my control.

03:46.000 --> 03:46.870
Xiao Qiushui,

03:47.870 --> 03:50.120
how will you respond to this?

04:00.470 --> 04:01.870
Sancai has sent word that

04:02.400 --> 04:04.000
General Wu will immediately

04:04.120 --> 04:06.030
return to the capital
after receiving the imperial order.

04:06.030 --> 04:06.760
Big Brother.

04:07.240 --> 04:08.710
If General Wu leaves the Immortal Pass,

04:08.710 --> 04:10.520
what if the Northern Wasteland
seizes the chance to attack?

04:10.520 --> 04:12.250
Wouldn't that be a big problem?

04:13.000 --> 04:13.870
Not only that,

04:15.120 --> 04:16.980
General Wu might also face danger

04:17.310 --> 04:18.970
on his way back to the capital.

04:19.269 --> 04:21.720
So we need to act quickly.

04:22.310 --> 04:23.040
Any delay

04:23.310 --> 04:25.440
will put General Wu in greater danger.

04:26.360 --> 04:28.760
We've all been investigating separately,

04:29.040 --> 04:29.870
and we've found some

04:29.870 --> 04:33.670
suspicious locations related to
the falconry whistle activities.

04:36.870 --> 04:39.470
Assemble people
to investigate immediately.

04:39.600 --> 04:40.040
Okay.

05:02.040 --> 05:02.920
Search carefully!

05:02.920 --> 05:03.600
-Yes!
-Yes!

05:17.360 --> 05:17.870
Yuhan.

05:17.870 --> 05:18.510
Guys.

05:18.830 --> 05:19.870
The outpost over there

05:19.870 --> 05:21.590
has been cleared by the Power Gang.

05:21.590 --> 05:22.510
-How about here?
-That's great.

05:22.510 --> 05:23.870
This must be the Falconry Whistle hideout.

05:23.870 --> 05:25.720
At least the Power Gang
knows better this time.

05:25.720 --> 05:27.360
Hope they cooperate with us properly
this time

05:27.360 --> 05:28.560
to catch those spies.

05:29.120 --> 05:30.850
Since Big Brother trusts them,

05:30.920 --> 05:31.580
let's do it.

05:32.070 --> 05:32.600
Let's go!

05:44.040 --> 05:44.570
Let's go.

05:51.430 --> 05:52.430
It's cooled down.

05:57.800 --> 05:59.200
Chief, is your old injury

05:59.270 --> 06:00.270
flaring up again?

06:01.040 --> 06:02.070
It's not that.

06:02.630 --> 06:04.480
He's simply unaware of his age

06:05.040 --> 06:06.580
and has been wearing himself out

06:06.580 --> 06:07.710
with constant work.

06:09.240 --> 06:10.440
Now that you're down,

06:10.510 --> 06:12.070
all the sect affairs, big and small,

06:12.070 --> 06:13.870
have all fallen on my shoulders.

06:14.800 --> 06:16.600
How's the situation over there?

06:18.830 --> 06:20.430
Xiao Kaiyan has been using
the Twelve Serial Docks

06:20.430 --> 06:21.120
as his base.

06:22.120 --> 06:23.630
The waterways are interconnected,

06:23.630 --> 06:26.510
and the hidden water networks
are extremely complex.

06:26.510 --> 06:28.480
We haven't found anything conclusive yet.

06:28.480 --> 06:30.240
Then send more people there.

06:30.800 --> 06:31.430
Yes.

06:33.310 --> 06:35.270
This is the information
that Song Mingzhu and others

06:35.270 --> 06:37.720
intercepted from Falconry Whistle.

06:42.870 --> 06:44.480
"20,000 elite soldiers will take
the water route,

06:44.480 --> 06:45.920
bypass the Immortal Pass to head south,

06:45.920 --> 06:48.780
and infiltrate Daxi to launch
a coordinated strike

06:49.159 --> 06:50.360
from inside and out."

06:57.830 --> 07:01.120
If the Northern Wastelanders
really succeed in crossing south,

07:01.120 --> 07:02.720
it would utterly crush

07:02.720 --> 07:05.680
the people's confidence
in resisting the Northern Wasteland.

07:05.680 --> 07:07.830
The Northern Wasteland is feigning peace,

07:07.830 --> 07:11.160
while secretly amassing
200,000 soldiers ready to strike.

07:11.480 --> 07:13.680
The court has summoned General Wu back,

07:13.870 --> 07:15.720
and morale at Immortal Pass is crumbling.

07:15.720 --> 07:17.780
The martial world is also in turmoil,

07:17.830 --> 07:20.120
and worse, some treacherous people,
bribed by the waterways,

07:20.120 --> 07:23.160
have gone so far as to commit treason
by colluding with the enemy.

07:23.160 --> 07:26.240
We must ensure General Wu's safety

07:27.360 --> 07:29.160
to stabilize the war situation.

07:29.480 --> 07:30.510
If he returns to the capital,

07:30.510 --> 07:32.270
I fear the Immortal Pass will fall.

07:32.270 --> 07:33.470
If he doesn't return,

07:34.600 --> 07:36.930
he'll be charged with fabricated crimes.

07:38.159 --> 07:39.360
If you report to His Majesty

07:39.360 --> 07:42.000
about the waterways' collusion
with the Northern Wasteland,

07:42.000 --> 07:44.830
could it soften the court's stance?

07:47.680 --> 07:48.210
Suifeng,

07:49.240 --> 07:49.870
gather more men

07:49.870 --> 07:51.310
to eliminate Falconry Whistle's base

07:51.310 --> 07:55.310
and block the Northern Wasteland's
elite troops from advancing south.

07:55.800 --> 07:56.270
Yes.

08:02.760 --> 08:04.960
I wish I could share more of your burden.

08:06.240 --> 08:08.270
I heard the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood

08:08.270 --> 08:11.240
is also trying to eliminate
Falconry Whistle's base.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.120
Daxi

08:13.830 --> 08:15.630
has finally come to such a state.

08:19.070 --> 08:19.720
Master.

08:22.120 --> 08:25.380
I have a feeling that
something's off with Chief's health.

08:26.640 --> 08:27.640
Keep an eye on him.

08:35.080 --> 08:35.720
Mr. Yan.

08:36.270 --> 08:37.870
You should move around less.

08:37.909 --> 08:38.440
Here.

08:38.909 --> 08:40.370
Take your medicine first.

08:40.720 --> 08:41.650
Physician Xiao.

08:41.840 --> 08:43.320
My injury has already healed.

08:43.320 --> 08:45.790
You need to take time to rest and recover.

08:46.120 --> 08:47.510
As for the Soul-Piercing Nail,

08:47.510 --> 08:50.710
Qiushui and I will have someone
to find another solution.

08:52.360 --> 08:54.090
This little injury is nothing.

08:55.030 --> 08:56.290
Don't make such a fuss.

09:26.010 --> 09:28.020
[Huaiyang]

09:39.840 --> 09:40.750
Chief Li.

09:41.720 --> 09:43.380
What's this supposed to mean?

09:43.630 --> 09:44.720
This Chief's Token

09:45.480 --> 09:47.680
is the Power Gang's symbol of authority

09:47.750 --> 09:50.870
and something revered
throughout the martial world.

09:51.720 --> 09:53.250
The reason all sects fear it

09:55.630 --> 09:57.030
is because the Power Gang

09:57.600 --> 09:59.630
holds dirt on every sect, isn't it?

10:03.000 --> 10:06.080
Mr. Xiao, you certainly know how to joke.

10:06.910 --> 10:08.870
Mr. Xiao, it seems

10:09.510 --> 10:11.440
you deeply despise our Power Gang.

10:12.840 --> 10:15.510
Relationships built on profit end
when profit does.

10:15.510 --> 10:18.440
Relationships built on influence collapse
when influence fades.

10:18.440 --> 10:21.320
Relationships built on power are abandoned
when power is lost.

10:21.320 --> 10:22.320
Chief Li.

10:22.910 --> 10:24.910
Don't you have to use the Misery Pill

10:25.030 --> 10:28.430
and the Tribulation Finger
to force people into submission?

10:35.120 --> 10:35.790
Indeed.

10:36.720 --> 10:38.250
But in these chaotic times,

10:39.000 --> 10:40.910
only by wielding powerful measures

10:40.910 --> 10:42.310
and clearing all hurdles

10:42.670 --> 10:44.320
can the situation be firmly stabilized

10:44.320 --> 10:46.270
for those who follow.

10:46.910 --> 10:49.910
By exchanging hearts with sincerity
and keeping ambitions modest,

10:49.910 --> 10:51.570
true friendship will endure.

10:51.630 --> 10:54.630
This is the only way we can rebuild
a new martial world.

10:54.670 --> 10:57.600
But your doings
resemble more the tactics of an emperor,

10:57.600 --> 10:59.400
not the way of the martial world.

11:01.440 --> 11:02.500
If that's the case,

11:02.750 --> 11:03.840
then Mr. Xiao,

11:04.270 --> 11:05.400
why don't you just be

11:05.510 --> 11:08.640
the successor
who rebuilds the way of the martial world?

11:09.320 --> 11:11.030
As long as one has a chivalrous heart,

11:11.030 --> 11:12.760
anyone can become a successor.

11:13.750 --> 11:15.960
Chief Li, you should take

11:16.480 --> 11:17.880
your Chief's Token back.

11:18.210 --> 11:20.030
Though we share the same destination,

11:20.030 --> 11:21.960
we can no longer walk the same path.

11:22.440 --> 11:24.720
I'm going to the capital for an audience
with His Majesty,

11:24.720 --> 11:26.650
and I must take my wine on schedule.

11:29.030 --> 11:29.720
Could it be

11:31.240 --> 11:32.440
the wine's poisoned?

11:48.270 --> 11:50.630
The poison has penetrated to
my bones and marrow.

11:50.630 --> 11:51.550
Now

11:53.320 --> 11:55.920
I'm truly gravely ill
and unlikely to recover.

11:56.870 --> 11:58.510
Since you know the wine's poisoned,

11:58.510 --> 12:01.080
why do you keep drinking it?

12:03.120 --> 12:04.440
I have no other choice.

12:09.510 --> 12:10.670
I fear not death,

12:11.950 --> 12:13.210
but I really don't know

12:13.400 --> 12:15.250
who else I can give this token to.

12:26.840 --> 12:27.510
Chief Li,

12:28.600 --> 12:30.200
you still don't understand.

12:30.670 --> 12:33.510
The martial world is like
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

12:33.510 --> 12:35.170
Even if I run around shouting,

12:35.630 --> 12:39.080
I can only awaken like-minded people.

12:39.790 --> 12:41.630
This is not a path of my own making,

12:41.630 --> 12:43.760
but the one that meets the hopes of all.

13:04.750 --> 13:05.390
So be it.

13:06.440 --> 13:08.840
The court intends to stop the war,

13:10.320 --> 13:12.670
so they've summoned General Wu
back to the capital.

13:12.670 --> 13:15.870
But now, the Northern Wasteland
has colluded with the waterways

13:15.870 --> 13:18.000
to infiltrate elite troops into Daxi.

13:18.080 --> 13:21.200
I believe this battle is inevitable.

13:22.320 --> 13:24.840
Therefore, we must not let General Wu

13:25.480 --> 13:26.880
leave the Immortal Pass.

13:27.080 --> 13:28.510
Then we must unite

13:29.840 --> 13:31.720
and do everything to rescue General Wu.

13:31.720 --> 13:34.670
The martial world
needs no leader hereafter.

13:35.200 --> 13:37.200
Driven by righteousness or by profit,

13:37.200 --> 13:38.930
everyone has their own choice.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.960
I must not tell Master

13:52.980 --> 13:54.580
about Chief being poisoned.

13:59.720 --> 14:00.320
Master.

14:02.750 --> 14:04.280
Just tell me what you heard.

14:04.870 --> 14:08.070
Chief is going to hand over
the Power Gang to Xiao Qiushui.

14:11.030 --> 14:12.630
What else did Chief mention?

14:14.840 --> 14:16.070
Chief also said

14:16.470 --> 14:18.730
that the Power Gang's ways are outdated,

14:18.870 --> 14:21.320
and he asked Xiao Qiushui
to lead everyone to transform

14:21.320 --> 14:23.720
and integrate into some new martial world.

14:25.390 --> 14:26.870
I really don't understand.

14:26.870 --> 14:28.630
Master, you've been completely loyal
to the Power Gang

14:28.630 --> 14:29.870
and served for so many years.

14:29.870 --> 14:31.800
Master, how could Chief bypass you

14:31.910 --> 14:33.910
and pass leadership to an outsider?

14:37.640 --> 14:40.570
Chief wouldn't hand over his position
for no reason.

14:41.720 --> 14:42.910
His actions today

14:44.720 --> 14:45.720
are very unusual.

14:49.080 --> 14:49.720
Could it be

14:51.270 --> 14:53.330
that his condition is as I've feared,

14:55.320 --> 14:56.520
beyond medical help?

14:57.360 --> 14:58.440
M-Master.

14:59.910 --> 15:00.910
You already knew?

15:07.910 --> 15:09.770
I want you to go somewhere with me.

15:13.270 --> 15:15.130
I haven't shown my face for years.

15:15.990 --> 15:18.240
A bunch of nobodies
seeking the Voidheart Codex

15:18.240 --> 15:19.840
have all come looking for me.

15:20.000 --> 15:20.930
Unfortunately,

15:21.320 --> 15:22.780
none of them can take a hit.

15:23.600 --> 15:25.480
Over the years in the martial world,

15:25.480 --> 15:27.630
each generation is worse than the last.

15:27.630 --> 15:29.960
It's becoming less and less interesting.

15:39.720 --> 15:40.320
You two,

15:40.870 --> 15:41.950
what exactly do you want?

15:41.950 --> 15:42.880
If you're smart,

15:43.080 --> 15:45.610
have Crazy Yan hand over
the Voidheart Codex!

15:46.440 --> 15:47.320
Cowards.

15:48.080 --> 15:50.270
If you've got the guts,
go see Mr. Yan yourselves.

15:50.270 --> 15:51.910
Going to him is no different from
seeking death.

15:51.910 --> 15:53.030
We're not that stupid.

15:53.030 --> 15:53.630
Attack!

16:34.910 --> 16:35.390
Hurry!

16:59.720 --> 17:01.600
The dart is poisoned. She won't get far.

17:01.600 --> 17:02.930
Everyone, split up and search!

17:02.930 --> 17:03.560
Let's go!

17:31.030 --> 17:31.960
Physician Xiao.

17:35.070 --> 17:36.000
Physician Xiao!

17:39.880 --> 17:41.030
It's Mr. Yan.

18:00.860 --> 18:01.900
Physician Xiao!

18:19.710 --> 18:21.310
Why is this whistle sound...

18:34.030 --> 18:34.720
Mr. Yan!

18:36.510 --> 18:37.440
Physician Xiao.

18:37.680 --> 18:39.680
How did this whistle end up with you?

18:54.680 --> 18:55.400
Yuan...

18:59.030 --> 18:59.880
You are Yuan?

19:01.750 --> 19:02.880
You really are Yuan.

19:03.270 --> 19:04.470
I finally found you.

19:07.840 --> 19:09.170
I'm your older brother.

19:10.640 --> 19:11.270
Brother?

19:11.820 --> 19:12.950
You don't remember?

19:14.410 --> 19:16.270
I understand why you don't remember me.

19:16.270 --> 19:17.160
But look.

19:17.550 --> 19:19.150
Look at this Golden Swallow.

19:19.180 --> 19:20.910
Does it remind you of anything?

19:21.000 --> 19:23.260
This is the only keepsake Mother left us.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.580
Only the sound of your whistle

19:25.750 --> 19:26.680
can awaken it.

21:01.360 --> 21:02.070
No wonder.

21:06.110 --> 21:07.200
All these days,

21:11.030 --> 21:12.310
I've been dreaming of

21:15.510 --> 21:16.440
my brother and me

21:19.450 --> 21:20.970
flying kites together.

21:24.810 --> 21:29.040
♪ This mortal world is written
with grudges and favors ♪

21:29.070 --> 21:29.790
I thought

21:30.420 --> 21:34.460
♪ Stories intertwine endlessly ♪

21:34.620 --> 21:36.050
it was all just a fantasy.

21:34.890 --> 21:39.070
♪ A young boy bearing a sword,
with wishes and thoughts ♪

21:38.580 --> 21:39.450
I thought

21:39.530 --> 21:43.590
♪ Rushes through the ever-changing
seas and lands ♪

21:42.620 --> 21:44.140
I could never reunite

21:43.810 --> 21:48.340
♪ Facing the perils of life,
watching time's passage ♪

21:45.030 --> 21:46.310
with my family.

21:48.860 --> 21:52.840
♪ Exploring the depths of
the martial world ♪

21:52.650 --> 21:53.510
I never thought

21:53.860 --> 21:58.090
♪ The wounds we bear
and the memories we paint ♪

21:57.220 --> 21:58.260
that you, Mr. Yan,

21:58.400 --> 22:02.590
♪ Weave together into a red thread ♪

22:00.110 --> 22:01.770
would actually be my brother.

22:03.850 --> 22:07.350
♪ Before the moonlight fades away ♪

22:04.880 --> 22:05.680
Yuan.

22:07.400 --> 22:09.390
♪ I want to ask once more ♪

22:08.920 --> 22:09.550
Brother.

22:09.600 --> 22:13.940
♪ Which star are you that lights my way ♪

22:11.640 --> 22:13.770
I've searched for you so desperately.

22:14.330 --> 22:18.280
♪ Raising wine and wielding a sword,
venturing between mountains and seas ♪

22:18.300 --> 22:22.460
♪ Don't forget the attachments
in your heart ♪

22:22.660 --> 22:25.380
♪ The mortal world,
fleeting as smoke and clouds ♪

22:25.640 --> 22:28.050
♪ Banished to the horizon ♪

22:28.070 --> 22:32.300
♪ I will accompany you to forget time ♪

22:33.030 --> 22:37.220
♪ With countless memories, we gradually ♪

22:37.450 --> 22:42.550
♪ Come to understand the meaning of fate ♪

22:43.550 --> 22:44.750
That day, Old Madam Wu

22:44.830 --> 22:46.830
entrusted the Golden Swallow to me.

22:47.140 --> 22:48.300
I never expected

22:48.750 --> 22:50.750
that the person you were looking for

22:51.310 --> 22:52.970
would turn out to be my sister.

22:54.070 --> 22:55.670
I remember when I was a child,

22:56.070 --> 22:57.670
I was kidnapped by villains.

22:58.920 --> 23:00.240
Due to the trauma

23:00.830 --> 23:02.400
and the injury to the back of my head,

23:02.400 --> 23:04.800
my childhood memories became very blurry.

23:05.880 --> 23:07.540
Thanks to the Golden Swallow,

23:07.720 --> 23:10.450
we siblings
have finally recognized each other.

23:10.730 --> 23:11.970
I'm truly happy

23:12.000 --> 23:14.000
that I got to see you again, Brother.

23:14.680 --> 23:17.510
But I came to the Xiao family
at a very young age,

23:18.180 --> 23:20.850
and they've always treated me
like their own daughter.

23:20.850 --> 23:21.850
You can be at ease.

23:24.070 --> 23:24.680
I...

23:25.710 --> 23:27.390
I've put you through so much.

23:28.160 --> 23:30.360
I don't even know
how to make it up to you.

23:30.830 --> 23:31.360
Brother,

23:32.400 --> 23:33.720
I ask for nothing else;

23:34.510 --> 23:36.510
I only hope you can agree to one thing
for me.

23:36.510 --> 23:37.110
Of course.

23:37.510 --> 23:38.040
Go ahead.

23:38.640 --> 23:40.640
The Soul-Piercing Nail in your body

23:40.640 --> 23:42.640
must be removed as soon as possible.

23:46.640 --> 23:47.270
Senior.

23:55.440 --> 23:56.040
All right.

23:59.750 --> 24:00.270
Good.

24:00.640 --> 24:02.750
Since you've agreed so readily, Senior,

24:02.750 --> 24:04.480
you can't change your mind now.

24:04.680 --> 24:05.610
Alright, Xueyu.

24:05.680 --> 24:07.000
Take good care of Senior.

24:07.000 --> 24:08.200
I'll go out for a while.

24:08.200 --> 24:09.310
Wait for me to come back.

24:09.310 --> 24:09.920
Qiushui,

24:10.640 --> 24:11.970
thank you for your help.

24:16.540 --> 24:20.550
[Tang Sect]

24:17.400 --> 24:18.790
During the Tang Sect incident,

24:18.790 --> 24:21.500
Tang Yaoshun and Old Madam Tang
were killed by Tang Song,

24:21.500 --> 24:24.360
and Tang Fang was also controlled
by puppet needle.

24:25.070 --> 24:25.880
This is weird.

24:27.000 --> 24:28.200
The gate is wide open,

24:28.720 --> 24:31.120
and there's not even a single guard
on duty.

24:31.680 --> 24:32.680
Stop right there.

24:34.640 --> 24:36.310
Take another half step forward,

24:36.310 --> 24:37.970
and your guts will be torn out.

24:48.870 --> 24:50.800
Thank you for the warning, Master.

24:52.640 --> 24:55.640
The Tang Sect doesn't open its gate
to welcome guests,

24:56.070 --> 24:57.200
but to face enemies.

25:06.680 --> 25:08.440
So are we going in or not?

25:09.400 --> 25:11.060
This isn't the only entrance.

25:30.270 --> 25:31.960
Who are these people?

25:32.920 --> 25:34.650
Why are they all locked up here?

25:35.110 --> 25:37.040
They're living medicine vessels.

25:38.200 --> 25:40.200
My blood is almost drained dry.

25:41.070 --> 25:42.330
Please stop taking it.

25:42.400 --> 25:43.130
Please stop.

25:43.720 --> 25:44.680
Please.

25:45.750 --> 25:46.760
Please stop.

25:48.330 --> 25:49.240
Please.

25:52.000 --> 25:53.400
Someone's finally here.

25:54.310 --> 25:56.310
Has Mr. Tang finally remembered me?

25:57.920 --> 25:58.880
I knew it.

25:59.000 --> 26:00.920
I knew he would need me,
the living medicine vessel

26:00.920 --> 26:03.240
he created with his own hands,
sooner or later.

26:03.240 --> 26:03.960
Mr. Tang

26:04.680 --> 26:05.680
is dead.

26:06.110 --> 26:06.680
What?

26:07.510 --> 26:08.310
How did he die?

26:09.030 --> 26:09.920
I killed him.

26:13.440 --> 26:14.310
Dead?

26:14.920 --> 26:16.350
He's actually dead?

26:20.400 --> 26:22.000
Becoming a living medicine vessel

26:22.000 --> 26:23.800
means suffering for a lifetime.

26:24.400 --> 26:25.600
I've held on until now

26:25.720 --> 26:27.240
just to wait for Mr. Tang,

26:27.440 --> 26:30.400
so I could kill him
with my own hands and get my revenge.

26:30.400 --> 26:32.530
And now, you tell me he's already dead,

26:32.550 --> 26:33.960
and that you killed him!

26:34.390 --> 26:36.870
How could you beat me to killing him?

26:48.070 --> 26:48.790
You old man.

26:49.110 --> 26:52.240
We hadn't even touched you,
yet you went and attacked us.

26:56.590 --> 26:57.440
Young man,

26:57.920 --> 26:59.920
that medicinal scent on you... You must be

26:59.920 --> 27:03.640
one of the living medicine vessels
Mr. Tang cultivated later, aren't you?

27:03.640 --> 27:05.240
But you're quite fortunate.

27:05.450 --> 27:08.310
You haven't become
a true living medicine vessel yet.

27:08.310 --> 27:09.550
Since you killed him,

27:10.270 --> 27:12.000
why have you come here?

27:12.480 --> 27:15.680
I want Mr. Tang's
Secret Method of Meridian Restoration.

27:15.920 --> 27:18.110
Once you become a living medicine vessel,

27:18.110 --> 27:20.480
you'll be controlled by others for life.

27:21.200 --> 27:23.680
Do you know that
the Secret Method of Meridian Restoration

27:23.680 --> 27:25.140
requires a life for a life?

27:25.440 --> 27:26.750
A life for a life?

27:28.690 --> 27:29.720
Of course I know.

27:33.880 --> 27:35.510
All those who treat lives as worthless

27:35.510 --> 27:36.600
deserve to die!

28:34.720 --> 28:35.240
Master.

28:35.720 --> 28:36.320
I found it.

28:43.680 --> 28:44.210
Let's go.

28:44.680 --> 28:46.310
-Let's go find Tang Fang.
-Being neither human nor ghost

28:46.310 --> 28:48.500
is the suffering of
being living medicine vessel!

28:48.500 --> 28:51.060
It's something
you should fully experience!

29:23.750 --> 29:24.810
Where is Tang Fang?

29:25.680 --> 29:27.110
If you hurt me now,

29:28.110 --> 29:29.710
she won't let you off easily.

29:42.680 --> 29:43.310
Fang.

29:54.440 --> 29:55.040
Tang Fang.

29:55.510 --> 29:56.510
Hurry up and do it.

29:57.310 --> 29:58.000
He's the one

29:58.510 --> 29:59.840
who killed your father.

30:00.310 --> 30:02.370
What nonsense are you talking about?

30:16.720 --> 30:17.780
Get the ring first!

30:24.200 --> 30:24.710
Fang!

30:38.840 --> 30:39.370
Brother.

30:41.010 --> 30:41.540
Let's go.

30:47.510 --> 30:48.110
Tang Fang!

30:50.370 --> 30:52.170
Master and I are here to save you.

30:58.430 --> 30:58.960
Let's go.

31:12.010 --> 31:14.290
Chief, this...

31:16.070 --> 31:17.200
Feel free to tell me.

31:18.680 --> 31:20.270
It's only been a few days,

31:21.010 --> 31:22.860
but the poison is spreading

31:23.310 --> 31:25.200
much faster than I expected.

31:25.830 --> 31:26.640
Chief,

31:27.150 --> 31:28.460
if you want to detox,

31:28.720 --> 31:30.920
as I mentioned before,

31:31.310 --> 31:32.640
only the Tang Sect's...

31:45.030 --> 31:45.640
Chief.

31:46.310 --> 31:47.640
The Strengthening Pill

31:47.680 --> 31:50.540
has miraculous effects
in strengthening the body.

31:51.920 --> 31:54.750
It may help alleviate
the poison within you.

32:00.640 --> 32:02.680
Herbal King is unable to
detoxify you, Chief,

32:02.680 --> 32:03.310
but I am.

32:11.200 --> 32:11.930
Herbal King.

32:13.240 --> 32:15.240
Please go to Mr. Xiao's place

32:15.750 --> 32:17.010
and check on Miss Tang.

32:18.070 --> 32:18.550
Yes.

32:25.280 --> 32:27.310
I'll use the Tang Sect's
living medicine vessel

32:27.310 --> 32:28.640
to detoxify you, Chief.

32:29.640 --> 32:30.350
Suifeng.

32:31.440 --> 32:32.680
You just heard it too.

32:34.030 --> 32:36.720
Herbal King gave me a Strengthening Pill.

32:37.480 --> 32:39.270
Now that you've joined the Power Gang,

32:39.270 --> 32:40.880
you're granted a new life.

32:41.510 --> 32:42.270
From now on,

32:43.440 --> 32:46.640
you don't have to be trapped
in these old grudges anymore.

32:47.640 --> 32:49.500
What you did for me before, Chief,

32:50.270 --> 32:51.510
I will never forget.

32:53.680 --> 32:54.920
Don't overthink it.

32:55.480 --> 32:56.280
You may go now.

33:11.310 --> 33:12.030
Mr. Xiao,

33:12.440 --> 33:14.500
the puppet needle in Miss Tang's body

33:14.830 --> 33:16.890
has penetrated into her bone marrow.

33:17.000 --> 33:17.750
If...

33:18.070 --> 33:18.920
If what?

33:19.510 --> 33:21.070
Please speak frankly, Senior.

33:21.070 --> 33:22.720
If there's any carelessness,

33:22.720 --> 33:25.590
the puppet needle
will lash back at its remover.

33:26.510 --> 33:27.270
Mr. Xiao,

33:27.680 --> 33:29.680
perhaps we should wait a bit longer.

33:29.680 --> 33:30.140
Senior,

33:31.110 --> 33:32.720
this is a matter of life and death.

33:32.720 --> 33:34.240
Since it has penetrated into
her bone marrow,

33:34.240 --> 33:35.680
we cannot wait any longer.

33:35.680 --> 33:38.200
I beg you to tell me
how to save her, Senior.

33:39.070 --> 33:39.920
Mr. Xiao,

33:40.480 --> 33:42.010
when removing the needles,

33:42.200 --> 33:44.070
you must protect yourself

33:44.480 --> 33:47.070
to prevent the puppet needle
from entering your meridians.

33:47.070 --> 33:49.680
Be extremely careful of the backlash.

33:50.070 --> 33:50.870
Otherwise...

34:59.000 --> 34:59.600
Tang Fang?

35:01.920 --> 35:02.550
Tang Fang.

35:07.320 --> 35:08.110
Qiushui.

35:10.520 --> 35:12.930
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

35:13.790 --> 35:16.560
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

35:14.880 --> 35:16.550
My... My father is dead.

35:18.180 --> 35:21.340
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

35:19.870 --> 35:21.400
Old Madam Tang is also dead.

35:21.690 --> 35:26.090
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

35:23.510 --> 35:24.840
T-The Tang Sect is gone.

35:26.230 --> 35:27.320
Everything is gone.

35:26.940 --> 35:30.340
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

35:30.720 --> 35:34.090
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

35:35.020 --> 35:37.840
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

35:36.230 --> 35:36.830
Tang Fang.

35:37.870 --> 35:42.560
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

35:38.280 --> 35:39.810
Focus on recovering first.

35:40.630 --> 35:42.430
Everything about the Tang Sect,

35:42.620 --> 35:44.620
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

35:43.920 --> 35:44.670
I'll help you with it.

35:44.640 --> 35:46.640
♪ A few words, laughter shared ♪

35:46.850 --> 35:49.590
♪ Swords and books,
the thrill of the blade ♪

35:50.180 --> 35:52.410
♪ Parting under thousands of miles
of wind, rain, and snow ♪

35:52.430 --> 35:57.780
♪ Embarking on the long road,
freely at ease ♪

35:58.620 --> 36:00.690
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

36:00.710 --> 36:02.710
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

36:02.740 --> 36:05.870
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

36:06.020 --> 36:08.330
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

36:08.350 --> 36:12.450
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

36:37.110 --> 36:37.640
Let's go.

36:38.510 --> 36:39.590
I'm the Rain Sword,

36:40.320 --> 36:40.960
Feng Lang.

36:43.840 --> 36:46.110
I had hoped to reunite with you

36:46.830 --> 36:47.690
in a better way.

36:50.420 --> 36:52.830
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

36:53.690 --> 36:56.460
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

36:58.080 --> 37:01.250
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

37:01.590 --> 37:05.990
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

37:06.840 --> 37:10.240
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

37:07.710 --> 37:08.440
Don't worry.

37:10.000 --> 37:12.150
I'm just here to deliver some medicine
for Herbal King.

37:10.620 --> 37:13.990
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

37:14.930 --> 37:17.750
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

37:17.070 --> 37:17.710
Feng.

37:17.770 --> 37:22.460
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

37:20.610 --> 37:21.420
Thank you.

37:22.490 --> 37:24.360
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

37:24.380 --> 37:26.380
♪ A few wild howls ♪

37:26.550 --> 37:29.610
♪ Come and go like flying birds ♪

37:27.930 --> 37:29.460
You haven't recovered yet.

37:30.020 --> 37:32.120
♪ Having witnessed countless miles
of sorrow and joy ♪

37:30.030 --> 37:31.440
Those people of the Tang Sect

37:31.440 --> 37:32.320
are colluding with the waterways.

37:32.140 --> 37:37.240
♪  I've naturally gained courage
to be a hero ♪

37:33.630 --> 37:35.160
Don't rush to seek revenge.

37:38.150 --> 37:39.000
Don't worry.

37:38.430 --> 37:40.350
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

37:40.370 --> 37:42.500
♪ Several rounds of turmoil ♪

37:40.670 --> 37:41.870
As for what they owe me

37:42.530 --> 37:45.500
♪ Swaying in life-and-death dreams ♪

37:42.880 --> 37:45.650
and all the evil
they've done in the martial world,

37:45.650 --> 37:47.340
I'll settle the score with them
sooner or later.

37:46.140 --> 37:48.140
♪ Shadows under countless lamps
over a thousand lifetimes ♪

37:48.160 --> 37:53.000
♪ Each leaves a single light
to shine through this night ♪

37:54.390 --> 37:59.610
♪ Heart like fine rain,
drifting with the clouds ♪

38:02.670 --> 38:03.330
Senior Yan.

38:03.880 --> 38:06.210
You just had
the Soul-Piercing Nail removed,

38:06.210 --> 38:07.410
so please drink less.

38:07.630 --> 38:08.960
If Xueyu finds out,

38:09.030 --> 38:10.830
you'll definitely get scolded.

38:11.710 --> 38:12.510
Have some too.

38:20.030 --> 38:21.070
I never thought

38:21.320 --> 38:23.920
that I, Crazy Yan,
the top fighter in the world,

38:24.110 --> 38:27.240
would actually be terrified of
a single glare from Yuan.

38:27.710 --> 38:29.040
Now that she's not here,

38:29.280 --> 38:31.410
I finally dare to have a drink with you.

38:31.480 --> 38:32.670
You're not terrified.

38:32.670 --> 38:34.000
You just care about her.

38:39.920 --> 38:41.180
I really didn't expect

38:41.480 --> 38:42.880
that you actually went to the Power Gang

38:42.880 --> 38:44.810
and brought Herbal King here for me

38:45.000 --> 38:46.860
to remove the Soul-Piercing Nail

38:47.070 --> 38:47.960
from my body.

38:49.150 --> 38:50.680
But the Soul-Piercing Nail

38:51.440 --> 38:52.770
had affected me deeply.

38:54.000 --> 38:55.460
I fear I may never recover.

38:55.630 --> 38:58.280
Don't tell Yuan about this for now.

39:02.920 --> 39:03.720
Let me ask you.

39:04.840 --> 39:06.920
What is the purpose of living?

39:09.840 --> 39:11.300
To savor life while alive,

39:11.550 --> 39:12.880
to die without regrets,

39:13.320 --> 39:15.450
and to do what righteousness demands.

39:15.630 --> 39:17.560
Then this life has not been in vain!

39:18.000 --> 39:19.660
This life has not been in vain!

39:30.630 --> 39:32.290
Make sure you get all the herbs

39:32.630 --> 39:34.510
listed on this prescription for me.

39:34.510 --> 39:35.710
No mistakes allowed.

39:36.880 --> 39:38.880
Why do you need these herbs, Master?

39:41.630 --> 39:42.890
Just do as you're told.

39:43.630 --> 39:45.360
Don't ask about anything else.

39:45.550 --> 39:46.880
I shouldn't have asked.

39:47.630 --> 39:50.360
-It's just I want to help...
-Are you doubting me?

39:51.880 --> 39:52.810
I wouldn't dare.

39:53.880 --> 39:55.410
Whatever your decision is,

39:55.840 --> 39:57.440
I'll help you accomplish it.

39:58.710 --> 40:00.910
I only wish to stay by your side, Master,

40:01.320 --> 40:02.710
until my last breath.

40:08.110 --> 40:08.770
Be careful.

40:09.670 --> 40:11.200
Let no outsider learn of it.

40:12.150 --> 40:12.760
Okay.

40:14.070 --> 40:17.000
I'll gather all the herbs for you
right away, Master.

40:25.320 --> 40:26.630
Buns! Buns!

40:26.710 --> 40:28.110
Come get your buns!

40:28.480 --> 40:30.320
Freshly steamed buns!

40:31.000 --> 40:32.150
Buns! Buns!

40:32.150 --> 40:33.320
Come buy some buns!

40:34.190 --> 40:35.250
Careful, it's hot.

40:37.030 --> 40:39.160
Deliver this medicine back to Master.

40:39.280 --> 40:40.280
Use the back door.

40:40.750 --> 40:41.270
Yes.

40:52.880 --> 40:54.680
Boss, I'll leave the money here.

40:56.110 --> 40:58.230
Red Phoenix, why would you have time
to visit a pharmacy?

40:58.230 --> 40:59.030
Of course

40:59.920 --> 41:01.320
I'm here to buy medicine.

41:01.670 --> 41:02.710
Is there a problem?

41:02.710 --> 41:04.150
The medicine you came specially to buy

41:04.150 --> 41:05.550
must be quite important.

41:05.800 --> 41:07.070
I'm curious to see it.

41:10.840 --> 41:12.670
Master caught a slight cold today,

41:12.670 --> 41:14.370
so I came specifically
to get some medicine for him.

41:14.370 --> 41:16.370
If you don't believe me, Blade King,

41:16.800 --> 41:17.860
feel free to check.

41:18.320 --> 41:21.850
Liu Suifeng had you come all the way
just to collect these herbs?

41:22.400 --> 41:23.320
Whatever concerns Master,

41:23.320 --> 41:24.590
I handle personally.

41:25.000 --> 41:26.280
It's none of your business.

41:26.280 --> 41:27.740
Our sect is in turmoil now.

41:28.070 --> 41:30.320
Who knows who the next traitor will be?

41:31.510 --> 41:32.440
I certainly hope

41:32.470 --> 41:34.270
this blade I made for Liu Suifeng

41:34.510 --> 41:35.970
will never need to be used.

41:37.320 --> 41:38.030
If it were,

41:38.150 --> 41:39.810
it would break Chief's heart.

41:41.230 --> 41:42.690
Rest assured, Blade King.

41:43.110 --> 41:44.320
This precious blade you forged

41:44.320 --> 41:46.450
will never be needed in this lifetime.

41:46.800 --> 41:49.320
Sorry that your trouble
has been for nothing.

41:49.320 --> 41:52.320
He's the most cunning and calculating one
in our sect.

41:53.440 --> 41:55.370
How can you guarantee his loyalty?

41:57.230 --> 41:58.840
I don't have to think about that.

41:58.840 --> 42:00.240
I only seek to follow him.

42:00.750 --> 42:01.750
If he's disloyal,

42:02.670 --> 42:04.110
then use that blade in your hand

42:04.110 --> 42:05.320
to kill me first.

42:05.510 --> 42:07.280
Defending such a cold-faced demon

42:07.280 --> 42:08.510
like this,

42:09.070 --> 42:10.400
it's truly surprising.

42:11.550 --> 42:14.000
That's because none of you
understand Master.

42:14.000 --> 42:15.530
He only appears heartless,

42:16.800 --> 42:19.460
but the deep affection
he has for those he values

42:21.880 --> 42:23.960
is beyond anything you could imagine.

42:23.960 --> 42:26.390
Since you're willing to
speak so highly of him,

42:26.390 --> 42:28.250
you must be someone he values too.

42:30.940 --> 42:32.450
Those Master truly values

42:35.930 --> 42:37.250
are very few indeed.
